From: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 02:39:12 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add gfx90a FP8 MFMA fallback

- Decode E4M3-FNUZ operands into FP16 values.
- Replace each unsupported gfx90a FP8 MFMA with
  two supported K=8 FP16 MFMA operations.
- Keep native FP8 MFMA paths on newer GPUs.
- Register E4M3-FNUZ as the gfx90a FP8 type.
- Add focused kernel correctness validation.

Tools used:
- GPT-5.6 Sol: gpt-5.6-sol-high

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
